# Failover site for ecschool.org.
#
# This site holds no content. Its only job is to bounce every visitor to
# ecschool.co, and it is only ever reached when Cloudflare's health check
# finds the GoDaddy origin down.
#
# 302, not 301: a 301 is cached by browsers as permanent, so visitors would
# keep landing on ecschool.co for weeks after GoDaddy recovered. The "!"
# forces the rule even for paths that exist, so /index.html below is only
# ever seen if this file itself fails to load.
# :splat carries the rest of the path over, so a visitor deep-linked to
# /lunch-menu lands on ecschool.co/lunch-menu rather than the home page.
/*  https://ecschool.co/:splat  302!
